WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
is potentially a problem in the future for Republicans.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.560
If a Democratic president someday calls the National Guard

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:09.760
to a red state over what they see as open rebellion,

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:14.320
but is what amounts to a demonstration that gets rowdy.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:15.640
I mean, is that not a fear here?

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.520
They're posting pictures of their kids

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.000
because it's a demonstration.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.100
They have a sniper on top of a building

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.719
firing a high caliber rifle at a nice facility

00:00:23.719 --> 00:00:25.320
because it's a demonstration

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.040
and they are engaging a vehicle ramming attack.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:29.080
But the National Guard isn't being sent to Texas.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:31.200
The National Guard isn't being sent to Dallas

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.040
where that sniper was.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.680
Because the Dallas Police Department

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:34.759
and the governor of Texas,

00:00:34.759 --> 00:00:36.439
well, you walked right into that one,

00:00:36.439 --> 00:00:39.400
have responded to every call for assistance and help.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.160
They gave a stand down order in Chicago

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.240
and they gave a stand down order in Portland.

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:45.240
Do you realize that there's 11,000

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:47.520
federal law enforcement officers in Oregon?

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:50.099
That's larger than the size of the FBI.

00:00:50.099 --> 00:00:52.500
Local and state police are resourced

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:55.500
to deal with this kind of riotous assembly,

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:56.520
but they have refused.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:58.000
They've been given a stand down order.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:01.119
They've arrested some 70 people since June.

00:01:01.119 --> 00:01:03.020
They've been arresting folks on the ground.

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:04.320
They've been arresting folks on the ground.

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:06.320
They refuse what you're saying outright.

